rc-plc/alabama/macon-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 53% of normal in September to October and 44% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 51% on the middle. Grid 14876 had its driest year in 1954 at 50%.</p>"}
